    "number": 213,
    "title": "Refresh work guide to current GitHub status",
    "body": "## Summary\n\nRefresh the static cross-project guide from a complete GitHub snapshot at 2026-09-23 23:55 UTC. It records 98 open issues: Hub 64, Nanoleaf 20, Pixoo 14. The snapshot includes the newly opened cache guidance and guide-check issues, closed story states needed by the guide, updated primary coverage, and merged-work history through the observed heads listed below.\n\nThe generated guide SHA-256 is `78c34357524f41e12aa746ea7820213570805636d819f04a94ad8f77e812daa6`. The history snapshot was fetched at 23:54 UTC from Hub `a19a62eb673fd17a5aecdb1db6b5575947e2feb7`, Nanoleaf `fad152e978e057258a9ebc8524469808107dbada`, and Pixoo `71fbefcfdcf6163fc7180264436a6360cbc371ae`.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `python3 docs/work-guide/work/build_guide.py` passed; rebuilding produced the same HTML hash.\n- `python3 docs/work-guide/work/test_maintenance.py` passed (10 tests).\n- `node docs/work-guide/work/check_guide.cjs` passed at 1440, 1000, 900, 768, 390 and 320 px, including task briefs, timeline, navigation, search, diagrams and print restoration; no page errors and no unexpected requests.\n- `git diff --check` passed. All changed paths are under `docs/work-guide/`.\n- Verification receipt and screenshots are in the main checkout at `.local/evidence/guide-status-20260923/`.\n\nThis is a dated snapshot; it does not implement live status fetching, install anything or operate devices. Public publication will follow this Hub source PR after its required review, merge and guide-only CI evidence.\n",
